ent-ScatteringGrenadeBase = { ent-GrenadeBase }
    .desc = { ent-GrenadeBase.desc }
ent-ClusterBang = clusterbang | clusterbang
    .desc = 僅可與閃光彈搭配使用。會連續爆炸數次。 | Can be used only with flashbangs. Explodes several times.
ent-ClusterBangFull = clusterbang | clusterbang
    .desc = 計時器倒數結束後，會發射三枚閃光彈。 | Launches three flashbangs after the timer runs out.
    .suffix = Full
ent-ClusterGrenade = 集束手榴彈 | clustergrenade
    .desc = 既然可以一次用三顆手榴彈，何必只用一顆呢！ | Why use one grenade when you can use three at once!
ent-ClusterBananaPeel = 成簇的香蕉皮 | cluster banana peel
    .desc = 拋出後會分裂成 6 片爆裂的香蕉皮，保證好玩！ | Splits into 6 explosive banana peels after throwing, guaranteed fun!
ent-SlipocalypseClusterSoap = slipocalypse clustersoap | slipocalypse clustersoap
    .desc = 落地時，會將少量辛迪加肥皂碎塊灑散在地面上。 | Spreads small pieces of syndicate soap over an area upon landing on the floor.
ent-GrenadeFoamDart = 泡沫飛鏢手榴彈 | foam dart grenade
    .desc = 會釋放出一陣令人困擾的泡沫飛鏢，造成嚴重的嘔吐。 | Releases a bothersome spray of foam darts that cause severe welching.
